# MANIFESTO OF DIGITAL SOVEREIGNTY (v2026.1)
**Founder:** David B. Ingalls | **Protocol:** PhoneServe

## THE COVENANT
This document serves as the founding law for the PhoneServe network. It establishes a "Gain-Share" economy where the platform only gains when the people gain.

### I. THE 90/10 DISTRIBUTION
The technical architecture of PhoneServe is hard-coded to favor the individual. 
* **90% User Stake:** All revenue generated by an individual node (mobile server) belongs to the owner of that device.
* **10% Freedom Fund:** A maintenance fee reserved for network security and developer support.

### II. THE GAIN-SHARE MANDATE
1. If the network is idle, the Protocol earns $0.
2. If the user earns $0, the Protocol earns $0.
3. The 10% maintenance fee is only unlocked once the 90% user payout is verified.
